{"curationManifestSha256":"8deda35e2cb9b2aae68a6d4e2614684605ec85d50bf2ff9dddd19f7e4588283b","curationVersion":"2026-07-30.2","lessonId":"lesson-1725","main":{"annotations":[],"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"“观今宜鉴古，无古不成今。”（《增广贤文》）流派众多的诸子学说，浩如烟海的古代史籍，都是弥足珍贵的文化遗产。深刻体悟前人的智慧，才能更好地把握当下与未来。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"本单元选取了《论语》、《孟子》、《庄子》中的经典篇章，以及《左传》、《史记》的精彩片段。阅读这些文章，有助于我们了解中华文化的一些重要理念，领会其中包含的人文精神，深化对传统文化的认识，增强文化自信。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"学习本单元，要在理解文意的基础上，整体把握经典选篇的思想内涵，认识其文化价值，思考其现代意义。初步了解儒家、道家思想的特征，体会相关篇章论事说理的技巧和不同的表达风格。阅读史传文，要关注其叙事曲折有序、写人生动传神的特点，尝试理性评价历史叙述中体现的思想、观念，认识历史人物和历史事件。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"frontMatter":[],"guidance":[],"links":[],"media":[{"alt":"","bytes":226144,"finalUrl":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/4/411c993e4fb1485e9d70f16f7390c5d3d152191c.jpeg","height":2386,"id":"media-81d8ede750ce63b47528","mediaType":"image/jpeg","nativeDisposition":"verified-in-app","receiptCollectedAt":"2026-07-30T01:10:43.464Z","receiptRequired":true,"rightsBasis":"user-authorized-course-source-use-2026-07-29","sha256":"39cf4e9e60da6c4da03ff6c2c3c8be6c7cd36c5d56492338530e412913bd7717","sourceUrl":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/4/411c993e4fb1485e9d70f16f7390c5d3d152191c.jpeg","webDisposition":"source-url","width":1680}],"sourceOnlyBlocks":[],"sourcePostId":11169,"sourcePostNumber":1},"mediaReceiptLedgerSha256":"0319bd9f7623eb57ee396cafc0343cb6c4dc51dce258109a19edbdddd91be71c","mediaReceiptLedgerVersion":"2026-08-09.1","provenance":{"links":[{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/4/411c993e4fb1485e9d70f16f7390c5d3d152191c.jpeg","postId":11169,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/4/411c993e4fb1485e9d70f16f7390c5d3d152191c.jpeg","text":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/4/411c993e4fb1485e9d70f16f7390c5d3d152191c.jpeg","title":null}],"media":[{"alt":"","bytes":226144,"finalUrl":"https://files.rdfzer.com/origina